				""
				"Time to make the neighbourhood a little less welcoming to the local wildlife."
				""
				"Place a torch. Then another. Keep going until you've placed &620 Torches&r."
				""
				"Walls, floors, ceilings — wherever they'll fit."
				""
				"Technically, nobody said they had to be different torches."
				""
				"Place the same one twenty times if that's your thing."
